spec.solo_play:
Solo is the complete game. Every job has a solo path:
- the pipe's green zone widens after each miss;
- Drag Solo moves the couch in 6 s;
- the raccoon leaves after 3 shoos.
A solo Tier 1 flip takes about 2.5 min and Tier 2 about 4.5 min. One solo Tier 1 flip pays for at least one 150-coin decor piece. The crew multiplier is upside only, never a solo penalty. Coin tools (power 2 and 3) give solo players the same speed-up a friend would. Listings show the buyer before purchase, so solo players can pick houses that match the styles they own. Setting the lot to Open lets passing players help with no chat.
